  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think that it would be super useful to add a feature similar to the language/pronoun box on the profile for the user's time zone, this would make it very easy for people to know what time is convenient for others without having to ask/memorize this information.\n\nIt is also fun and useful to know what time it is for someone when you are talking to them, this feature would help to make interactions have one less issue that is not present in real life conversations.",
